 Dinniman/Dungeon Crawler Carl/1 - Dungeon Crawler Carl","isFile":false,"mtimeMs":1765747944395,"ctimeMs":1765747944395,"birthtimeMs":1749069893033,"addedAt":1749069911979,"updatedAt":1765843526424,"isMissing":false,"isInvalid":false,"mediaType":"book","media":{"id":"f7ed061d-1cb2-473f-a769-7e2cae949c12","metadata":{"title":"Dungeon Crawler Carl","titleIgnorePrefix":"Dungeon Crawler Carl","subtitle":null,"authorName":"Matt Dinniman","authorNameLF":"Dinniman, Matt","narratorName":"","seriesName":"Dungeon Crawler Carl #1.0","genres":["LitRPG","Apocalyptic","Humor"],"publishedYear":"2020","publishedDate":null,"publisher":"Dandy House","description":"\nThe apocalypse will be televised!\nA man. His ex-girlfriend's cat. A sadistic game show unlike anything in the universe: a dungeon crawl where survival depends on killing your prey in the most entertaining way possible. \nIn a flash, every human-erected construction on Earth—from Buckingham Palace to the tiniest of sheds—collapses in a heap, sinking into the ground. \nThe buildings and all the people inside have all been atomized and transformed into the dungeon: an 18-level labyrinth filled with traps, monsters, and loot. A dungeon so enormous, it circles the entire globe. \nOnly a few dare venture inside. But once you're in, you can't get out. And what's worse, each level has a time limit. You have but days to find a staircase to the next level down, or it's game over. In this game, it's not about your strength or your dexterity. It's about your followers, your views. Your clout. It's about building an audience and killing those goblins with style. \nYou can't just survive here. You gotta survive big. \nYou gotta fight with vigor, with excitement. You gotta make them stand up and cheer. And if you do have that \"it\" factor, you may just find yourself with a following. That's the only way to truly survive in this game—with the help of the loot boxes dropped upon you by the generous benefactors watching from across the galaxy. \nThey call it Dungeon Crawler World. But for Carl, it's anything but a game.","isbn":null,"asin":null,"language":"en","explicit":false,"abridged":false},"coverPath":"C:\\Users\\alxno\\AppData\\Local\\Audiobookshelf\\metadata\\items\\59ef1e74-5d9b-4097-a37a-99969a64460a\\cover.jpg","tags":[],"numTracks":0,"numAudioFiles":0,"numChapters":0,"duration":0,"size":1149799,"ebookFormat":"epub"},"numFiles":1,"size":1149799},{"id":"9523a4d7-7168-4fd2-8eec-3f871f9a5dc1","ino":"1125899906924025","oldLibraryItemId":null,"libraryId":"afaa178b-e2a9-4b8c-b80f-e592faca091d","folderId":"58c29b46-e133-465a-905c-92b15f0536ed","path":"F:/Books/Matt Dinniman/Dungeon Crawler Carl/3 - The Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook","relPath":"Matt Dinniman/Dungeon Crawler Carl/3 - The Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook","isFile":false,"mtimeMs":1749069898850,"ctimeMs":1749069898850,"birthtimeMs":1749069898843,"addedAt":1749069912700,"updatedAt":1765843526540,"isMissing":false,"isInvalid":false,"mediaType":"book","media":{"id":"4e1adf95-7509-4e1a-8bda-b2f57d8ff378","metadata":{"title":"The Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook","titleIgnorePrefix":"Dungeon Anarchist's Cookbook, The","subtitle":null,"authorName":"Matt Dinniman","authorNameLF":"Dinniman, Matt","narratorName":"","seriesName":"Dungeon Crawler Carl #3","genres":[],"publishedYear":null,"publishedDate":null,"publisher":null,"description":null,"isbn":null,"asin":null,"language":null,"explicit":false,"abridged":false},"coverPath":"C:/Users/alxno/AppData/Local/Audiobookshelf/metadata/items/9523a4d7-7168-4fd2-8eec-3f871f9a5dc1/cover.jpg","tags":[],"numTracks":0,"numAudioFiles":0,"numChapters":0,"duration":0,"size":805084,"ebookFormat":"azw3"},"numFiles":1,"size":805084},{"id":"81bbf3bc-a6ae-4136-87fd-bc06d30472a4","ino":"1407374883634372","oldLibraryItemId":null,"libraryId":"afaa178b-e2a9-4b8c-b80f-e592faca091d","folderId":"58c29b46-e133-465a-905c-92b15f0536ed","path":"F:/Books/MoonReader","relPath":"MoonReader","isFile":false,"mtimeMs":1765053518523,"cti